# VetBuddy Benefit Vault research ledger, batch 02 (IL, IN, IA, KS, KY, LA, ME, MD, MA, MI)
# Format: CAT|TITLE|GROUPS|RULE|ELIGIBLE|VALUE|URL  (see data/research/RESEARCH_LOG.md)
# Rules encode necessary conditions only; ELIGIBLE carries the rest. Every row is UNVERIFIED until a
# named reviewer checks the URL (G1). Compiled from MyArmyBenefits state pages fetched 2026-10-27.
# PAGE as a URL means the benefit had no link of its own; the importer substitutes the SRC page.

